                        "form": "das Hütchenspiel"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "bebf69c4-e797-4640-8347-7bd0ecad517e",
                        "entry_id": "6a18dbe1-465d-3e3e-a645-ae06044d1202",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Hütchenspiele"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6ae86b55-e817-3e0a-a17d-1c9e60e04d50",
                        "entry_id": "6a18dbe1-465d-3e3e-a645-ae06044d1202",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ein (Straßen-)Glücks-Spiel mit drei Hütchen bzw. Nussschalen und einer Kugel, die scheinbar unter eines der Hütchen gelegt wird; daraufhin werden die Hütchen mehrmals verschoben und ein (leichtgläubiger) Passant wird überredet, gegen Geldeinsatz zu raten, unter welchem Hütchen sich die Kugel befindet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "60efc81c-e244-4918-b711-fb75af1cfd5a",
                                "sense_id": "6ae86b55-e817-3e0a-a17d-1c9e60e04d50",
                                "text": "„Gerade beim Hütchenspiel haben schon etliche Menschen große Summen aufs Spiel gesetzt und natürlich verloren, denn die Chance auf einen Gewinn ist bei der Geschicklichkeit der Gaukler gleich Null.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0e3cbea7-2bca-4ef8-b8cb-49ca26642c8e",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a18dbe1-465d-3e3e-a645-ae06044d1202",
                        "source_sense_id": "6ae86b55-e817-3e0a-a17d-1c9e60e04d50",
                        "target_lang_word": "shell game",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "shell game",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "effd6458-c00f-3f38-909d-7c9a3881e5cb",
                                        "entry_id": "6cad61c2-494a-34af-adf9-3aec6f802fbc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game of skill which requires the bettor to guess which of three small cups (or shells) a pea-sized object is concealed under, after the party operating the game rapidly rearranges them, providing opportunity for sleight-of-hand trickery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2fc6311-4b4d-4d05-b119-524cc6b7e3a4",
                                                "sense_id": "effd6458-c00f-3f38-909d-7c9a3881e5cb",
                                                "text": "Another common form of short con is the shell game. This scam has the advantage of giving the criminal the ability to rip off many marks all at one location."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7cecd26-01fb-309a-8b90-436791c9a69d",
                                        "entry_id": "6cad61c2-494a-34af-adf9-3aec6f802fbc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any confidence scheme, especially one involving the rapid movement of investment funds to a location beyond recovery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3c69a92c-965d-48d5-95f7-ceefeaa8529a",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a18dbe1-465d-3e3e-a645-ae06044d1202",
                        "source_sense_id": "6ae86b55-e817-3e0a-a17d-1c9e60e04d50",
                        "target_lang_word": "thimblerig",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thimblerig",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "098824f5-faf9-321f-b2a1-44861ab49774",
                                        "entry_id": "3ce543ad-cd7e-376c-8b13-8136c3abf613",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game of skill which requires the bettor to guess under which of three small cups (or thimbles) a pea-sized object has been placed after the party operating the game rapidly rearranges them, providing opportunity for sleight-of-hand trickery; a shell game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e7a5698-869b-4e1d-bc41-ce8fbb7d10ce",
                                                "sense_id": "098824f5-faf9-321f-b2a1-44861ab49774",
                                                "text": "He’ll muddle away the Begum’s fortune at thimble-rig, be caught picking pockets, and finish on board the hulks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0ea6939-a30c-40e0-beab-27b0b35dec1c",
                                                "sense_id": "098824f5-faf9-321f-b2a1-44861ab49774",
                                                "text": "‘Great Barnums?’ says I. ‘You're a ringer for a circus thimblerig man.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d32614c-5147-37dd-b3b1-9eeb8a1b721e",
                                        "entry_id": "3ce543ad-cd7e-376c-8b13-8136c3abf613",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One operating such a game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "thimblerig",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84ca7995-9c99-347e-a066-9d1206ad3926",
                                        "entry_id": "5cf039c8-dac8-306d-8529-80fa06fad10b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cheat in the thimblerig game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5017392f-82c2-48f9-b0f1-e26c33e85744",
                                                "sense_id": "84ca7995-9c99-347e-a066-9d1206ad3926",
                                                "text": "Old Pratt is a different kind of crook—a psalm-singing, pussyfooted old buccaneer, teaching a Bible class on Sundays and thimblerigging in Wall Street on week days."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fdd4ac4-589d-3879-ab53-a3ff4f056739",
                                        "entry_id": "5cf039c8-dac8-306d-8529-80fa06fad10b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cheat (someone) by trickery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1cfd5a9-e3d5-44e3-bbf6-e078d55c6c6d",
                                                "sense_id": "8fdd4ac4-589d-3879-ab53-a3ff4f056739",
                                                "text": "The favor is to you. I do not permit any man to thimblerig his debts to me into my debts to him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
